{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"docker.io/hashicorp/http-echo","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:05:25.596Z","source":{"name":"Docker Hub","api":"https://hub.docker.com/v2/repositories/hashicorp/http-echo/","page":"https://hub.docker.com/r/hashicorp/http-echo"},"readme":"# http-echo Server\nhttp-echo is an in-memory web server that renders an HTML page containing the contents of the arguments provided to it. This is especially useful for demos or a more extensive \"hello world\" Docker application.\n\n## Usage\n\n```\ndocker run -p 5678:5678 hashicorp/http-echo -text=\"hello world\"\n```\n\nAnd then visit http://localhost:5678/ in your browser and see \"hello world\".\n\nTo change the port the service is listening on, specify the `-listen` flag:\n\n```\ndocker run -p 8080:8080 hashicorp/http-echo -listen=:8080 -text=\"hello world\"\n```","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"hashicorp","url":"https://hub.docker.com/u/hashicorp","official":false,"verified":false},"registered":"2016-09-28T00:52:25.523395Z","updated":"2023-10-10T21:40:34.420593Z","categories":["Networking","Web servers","Monitoring & observability"],"keywords":[],"license":null,"links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":112557310,"stars":81},"mediaTypes":["application/vnd.docker.container.image.v1+json","application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json"],"contentTypes":["image"],"storage":30635361,"tags":[{"name":"latest","digest":"sha256:fcb75f691c8b0414d670ae570240cbf95502cc18a9ba57e982ecac589760a186","pushed":"2023-10-10T21:40:34.234705Z","size":4625474,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"1.0","digest":"sha256:fcb75f691c8b0414d670ae570240cbf95502cc18a9ba57e982ecac589760a186","pushed":"2023-10-10T21:40:31.532516Z","size":4625474,"platforms":["linux/amd64","linux/arm64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.list.v2+json","status":"active"},{"name":"1.0.0","d